for the buttons (how they work) if you need to set a scriptcall
to them, use:  SQSM.OpenQuestJournal();  to open the questScene.

Thanks so much for this! I'm on the free MZ version, and I keep getting this crash when I open up the Journal (also the quest pointer stops working):
SyntaxError
Unexpected token u in JSON at position 0
Dev tools seems to say it's related to:
style="z-index: 1; position: absolute; margin: auto; top: 0px; left: 0px; right: 0px; bottom: 0px; width: 1280px; height: 720px; touch-action: none; cursor: inherit; opacity: 0.5; filter: blur(8px);"
The script I've used for that part is:
SQSM.ShowDescriptionForQuest("myQuest2", 5);
SQSM.ShowTaskForQuest("myQuest2", 5);
SQSM.CompleteTaskForQuest("myQuest2", 4);
The ones that worked earlier were just variations of this, like:
SQSM.ShowDescriptionForQuest("myQuest2", 4);
SQSM.ShowTaskForQuest("myQuest2", 4);
SQSM.CompleteTaskForQuest("myQuest2", 3);
For other plugins, I'm using the VisuStella essentials but nothing else.
I've done fresh saves, tried comparing the notes to other journal quests that worked, looked at the descriptions, tasks... and I can't work it out. I'm not super good at scripting or with plugins. Hope someone can help and give me some tips to fix it

